---
description: Audit websites/apps/code with the JRiSpace webapp-audit skill
alwaysApply: false
---
When the user asks to audit, review, grade, or pre-launch check a site, app or codebase:

1. Run `python3 ~/.config/ai-agents/skills/webapp-audit/scripts/audit.py <url|path> --deep`
2. Read the `audit-report.md` it writes.
3. Report the grade table first, then only critical/high findings with their evidence line.
4. Never claim a finding is fixed without re-running the audit.
